    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know those numbers exist but they dont change the reality of sitting in this room every day. it doesnt change the fact that it never ends. i'm just so tired of being the strong one. i'm tired of waking up and realizing i have to do it all over again. it feels like there's no actual light at the end of this, just more of the same.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
